# Keep GitHub's language statistics representative of the application code.
#
# data/ holds the generated SQLite database and derived artifacts. Everything
# in it except .gitkeep is gitignored, so it contributes nothing to the
# language bar today; this rule exists so that stays true if data files are
# ever committed.
data/** linguist-vendored

# Working notes, design documents and build plans. Linguist already excludes
# Markdown from the language bar, so this is a classification for GitHub's
# file listing rather than a change to the percentages.
docs/** linguist-documentation
